{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/9c5a2ef2f03b66513e7a36f247785326.webp?t=1762538942\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind Split is a top-down puzzle game that challenges you to control two characters moving in opposite directions at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/4c9ba88a2bc449793828c5128f2ff057.avif?t=1762538942\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/b95b8931fcf4929cd18b176e5dfb7c6d.webp?t=1762538942\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the editor mode, you can place the abilities you need in designated areas before the level begins.<br>Careful planning is essential: Which ability will help which character? Think ahead, position wisely, and test your strategy.<br><strong>But beware\u2014there's no going back once you've made your move.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/c65433323b79d410df5746b95974e608.poster.avif?t=1762538942\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/c65433323b79d410df5746b95974e608.webm?t=1762538942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/c65433323b79d410df5746b95974e608.mp4?t=1762538942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/38064a24409d68ccf5ddbad6ce44804b.webp?t=1762538942\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique puzzle experience, you control two characters simultaneously\u2014one can only move in the dark, while the other can only walk in the light.<br>You\u2019ll need to balance both sides, master the rules of their worlds, and switch between light and shadow with precision.<br>Timing, strategy, and insight will be your greatest allies on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/93a33a935812834e8aa498010bba55f9.poster.avif?t=1762538942\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/93a33a935812834e8aa498010bba55f9.webm?t=1762538942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/extras/93a33a935812834e8aa498010bba55f9.mp4?t=1762538942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan. Execute. Find the balance.</strong><br>Can Light and Shadow be united once again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer Music: <i>Dj Quads \u2013 It Just Makes Me Happy</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685530?t=1762538942","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685530?t=1762538942","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685530/8dba9b9492ed75576107507b6cfc0b1fe3566e6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762538942","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/